<LegalLayout title="Cookies Policy" updated="9 September 2026">
  <p>
    The <strong>openeam.it</strong> website uses only <strong>technical cookies</strong>,
    strictly necessary for browsing and for the platform to function correctly.
  </p>

  <h2>Technical cookies</h2>
  <p>
    These cookies are essential for the site to work (for example, to remember your
    browsing preferences or keep a session active) and do not require the user's prior
    consent under the GDPR and the related measure issued by the Italian Data
    Protection Authority (Garante) on cookies. They do not store identifying
    information for marketing purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>No profiling or tracking</h2>
  <p>
    The site <strong>does not use profiling cookies or third-party tracking cookies</strong>
    (for example, for behavioural advertising or third-party statistical analysis).
    A consent-collection banner is therefore not required: we still inform you that
    only technical cookies are used via the notice shown on the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Managing cookies from your browser</h2>
  <p>
    You can manage, block, or delete technical cookies at any time through your
    browser settings. Please note that disabling technical cookies may affect the
    correct functioning of some pages of the site. Instructions for managing cookies
    are generally available in the "Settings" or "Privacy" section of your browser
    (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge, etc.).
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
